1. ग्रथ् or ग्रन्थ् cl. 9. P. ग्रथ्ना॑ति (fut. p. ग्रन्थिष्यत्, Kāṭh. xxv, 8; perf. 3. pl. जग्रन्थुर् or ग्रेथुर्, Pāṇ. i, 2, 6; Siddh.; ind.p. ग्रन्थित्वा or ग्रथ्˚, 23, Kāś.),
to fasten, tie or string together, arrange, connect in a regular series, TS. vi f.; Kāṭh. xxv, 8; Bhaṭṭ.;
to string words together, compose (a literary work), Prab. vi, 5 : cl. 1. P. Ā. ग्रथति, ˚ते, Dhātup. (v.l.);
 P. ग्रन्थति, xxxiv, 31;
 Ā. ग्रन्थते (aor. अग्रन्थिष्ट), to be strung together or composed (a literary work), Bhāradv. on Pāṇ. iii, 1, 89 :
Caus. P. Ā. ग्रन्थयति, ˚ते, to string together, MBh. iv, 262;
